":"00"}],"title":"Expressing support for the recognition of May 4 through May 10, 2025, as Wildfire Preparedness Week, the national event educating the public on fire safety and preparedness, and supporting the goals of a Wildfire Preparedness Week.","type":"hres","updateDate":"2026-06-01T15:01:38Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-06-01T15:01:38Z"}
